  "body": "Not often found these days.  \r\n* A 2 bedroom brick and tile with a Freehold Title\r\n* Ideal remodeling project over the Xmas period - wont cost the world\r\n* Easily live in it while you do the work - what else do you have to do over Christmas!.  \r\n* Located directly opposite the Glamorgan School,  no excuse for the kids to be late. \r\n* Large storage and garaging under with additional parking.  \r\n* Being freehold, there is some land where you could build a carport or grow a garden, or easily leave as it is.  \r\n* There is also the benefit of having an enclosed private northern courtyard for the BBQ.\r\n\r\nArrange a viewing or see you at the open homes.",
